docs {
  **Method:** `GET`
  **Endpoint:** `/api/v1/admin/users`
  **Auth:** Required (ADMIN)

  ## Description

  Retrieves a paginated and filterable list of all registered users.

  ## Request

  ### Query Parameters

  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `page` | `integer` | No | Page number (default: 1) |
  | `limit` | `integer` | No | Items per page (default: 20, max: 100) |
  | `status` | `string` | No | Filter by account status (`ACTIVE`, `INACTIVE`) |
  | `role` | `string` | No | Filter by system role (`USER`, `ADMIN`) |
  | `search` | `string` | No | Search query for name, email, phone, or friend code |

  ## Response

  **`200 OK`**
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "data": {
      "items": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "name": "Default User",
          "friend_code": "DR-7K9M2X8Q4P6R",
          "email": "user@doratou.local",
          "phone": "+989123456789",
          "is_email_verified": true,
          "is_phone_verified": false,
          "avatar_attachment_id": null,
          "system_role": "ADMIN",
          "status": "ACTIVE",
          "wallet": 0,
          "telegram_chat_id": null,
          "telegram_user_id": null,
          "created_at": "2026-11-11T10:00:00Z"
        }
      ],
      "pagination": {
        "page": 1,
        "limit": 20,
        "total": 1
      }
    }
  }
  ```

  ## Errors

  * `400 Bad Request` — Invalid pagination or filter parameters
  * `401 Unauthorized` — Missing or invalid token
  * `403 Forbidden` — Insufficient permissions (requires ADMIN role)
}
